
Nambari jifunze: ['plus:'] maana: ['+'].
Nambari ikija: ['+'] fanya: { :x
	>> rate := 1.
	>> currency := x kizio.
	(currency = ['euros']) kweli: {
		rate := 2.
	}. <- (binafsi plus: (x × rate)).
}.
>> dollars := 3.
>> euros := 2.
dollars kipimo: ['dollars'].
euros kipimo: ['euros'].
>> money := dollars + euros.
Towe andika: money, mstari-mpya.
